{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"secret","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A short credential that is itself a failure line is persisted unredacted because the surrounding redaction window defeats the exact-field match."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After an upgrade, reinspecting an unchanged failure can create a duplicate fix request and, in narrow cases, start an extra fix round that wastes work."}]}